Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:46:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD immediate Vim visual selection with v so focused
 panes copy in one step

The terminal UI treats v as the start of character visual selection for the active pane, so copying begins with one command-mode keystroke while keeping pane-local movement, yank, and jump behavior covered by terminal and harness tests.
